+
+I also independently reimplemented the pipeline-v3 typed tree digest. It
+matched:
+
+- candidate tree:
+  `51a4dc5ddafccf70941442bac319702a7b31d8d6b241615061bc3f35a7a32aca`
+  in both `generation-result.json` and `invocation.json`;
